  <h2>What We Test</h2>
  <p>Software testing is not one thing. A well-built QA function covers multiple layers: the UI, the API, the data pipelines, the cross-browser edge cases, the regression risk, and the features your users actually care about. goGreenlit provides coverage across all of it – choosing the right tool for each layer rather than applying the same technique to every problem.</p>
  <p>Our testing services are designed for teams that ship on a regular cadence and need QA that keeps up. We don't run waterfall test cycles. We test inside agile sprints: writing test cases in sprint planning, executing during the sprint, reporting in standup, and filing defects while there is still time to fix them before the release.</p>

